{"asset_key":"mn3/quest_story_10292280","episode":"mn3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"10292280","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1029228001:1":{"text":"絶対的な力の魅力を思い知ったか？特訓を続ければ、俺ほどではないが、少なくとも今より遥かに強くなれるぞ！","source_cn":"见识到绝对力量的魅力了吗？如果坚持特训的话，你们虽然不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31AC564B77122E3F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1029228002:1":{"text":"どんなお宝でも最後には消えてしまう。力だけは永遠に裏切らないんだ！","source_cn":"不管什么宝物，最终都会消失，只有力量永远不会背叛！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x888C6615E62C2E2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1029228003:2":{"text":"えっと……シャキールさんの言う通りです！お宝なんてまったく当てになりませんよね！","source_cn":"呃……沙奎尔老大说得太对了！宝物什么的根本就靠不住啊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9772F4EC0F9F7CF5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1029228004:1":{"text":"その通り。お前はようやく力の価値に気づいたようだな。","source_cn":"不错。看来你终于能意识到力量的重要性了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0040A6D809F2C5B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1029228005:1":{"text":"それで……このお宝を売った分け前をあなたにも渡すから、見なかったことにするっていうのはどうですか？","source_cn":"所以……沙奎尔老大，你看这样如何？我们一起卖掉这个宝物...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089B38F5EE1642BA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","doc